{"title":"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The glass gauge on a cylindrical coffee maker shows that there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f27da4fca6f3fecb215974023aad210b70ec3857.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> cups left when the coffee maker is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/9/219d19a2cd739683cc264acbc4340e000f0bfd5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> full.  How many cups of coffee does it hold when it is full?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/c/dec89f0ccd7eb47c1e1cf47a809a84ce8d61d182.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 80 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 100 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 125 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 130 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 262$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"412\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/f/58f83059cccddda489555126f685731af69d8259.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((5,0)..(0,-1.3)..(-5,0)); draw((5,0)--(5,10)); draw((-5,0)--(-5,10)); draw(ellipse((0,10),5,1.3)); draw(circle((.3,1.3),.4)); draw((-.1,1.7)--(-.1,7.9)--(.7,7.9)--(.7,1.7)--cycle); fill((-.1,1.7)--(-.1,4)--(.7,4)--(.7,1.7)--cycle,black); draw((-2,11.3)--(2,11.3)..(2.6,11.9)..(2,12.2)--(-2,12.2)..(-2.6,11.9)..cycle); [/asy]\" width=\"188\" height=\"252\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the number of cups of coffee that the coffee maker can hold when it is full.  Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/5/c853c20da48aae4d537ac847ab0bcc9c8623d3a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$.36x=45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"78\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/9/ff9d25f059abdbeace900099916cc578d6a30530.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x= \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 125}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"109\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME\" title=\"1988 AJHSME\">1988 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1988 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1988\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Probl